---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use"
  description="The short, readable terms for using My Lab Tests."
  path="/terms/"
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Terms', path: '/terms/' }]}
>
  <div class="prose-tight max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl">Terms of use</h1>
    <p>Using this site means you're okay with the following:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
      <li>
        The site provides price and service comparisons for information only.
        The <a href="/disclaimer/" class="text-navy underline">disclaimer</a> is
        part of these terms — nothing here is medical advice.
      </li>
      <li>
        Prices and package details are collected automatically and can lag the
        lab's website. The lab's own checkout price prevails.
      </li>
      <li>
        Bookings, payments, sample handling and reports are contracts between
        you and the lab. We're not a party to them and carry no liability for
        the lab's services.
      </li>
      <li>
        Content and code of this site belong to My Lab Tests. Quote freely with
        a link; don't republish wholesale.
      </li>
      <li>
        Don't scrape this site at volumes that degrade it for others. (Labs:
        for data questions use the <a href="/contact/" class="text-navy underline">contact page</a>.)
      </li>
      <li>These terms are governed by Indian law.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
